{"id":"P083-1","subject":"P","unit":"P083","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P083-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n대지로부터 2m 떨어진 위치에 대지와 수평으로 배치되\n\n어있는 선도체가 있다. 이 도체의 선전하 밀도가 Cm\n일 때, 선도체에 작용하는 힘은 몇 Nm인가?\n\n\n                   \n①            ②                              \n\n                             \n③            ④                              ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":605},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1464}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n수조 내부 중심에 직경을 작게한 좁은 입상관이 세워져 있\n\n고, 하단에는 좁은 연결관으로 연결된 구조를 가지며, 유속의\n\n급변시 수차에 도달하는 유량을 서서히 변화시켜 수차로\n\n유입되는 물의 공급을 안정적으로 유지할 수 있는 수조는?\n\n\n① 단동조압수조     ② 소공조압수조\n\n③ 수실조압수조     ④ 차동조압수조","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1834},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m02-e2.webp","width":678,"height":794}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n효율이 40인 화력발전소에서 발열량 5500kalkg의\n석탄 4.3ton을 사용할 때의 발생 전력량은 몇 kWh인\n\n가?\n\n\n① 8200         ② 8500\n\n③ 11000        ④ 11500","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":513},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m03-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1090}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n6600V의 비접지식 선로에서 1선 지락사고가 발생한 경우,\n\n건전상의 대지전압의 상승은 몇 배인가?\n\n①          ② \n\n                            \n③            ④                           ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":601},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1561}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n단절연이 가능한 접지방식으로, 1선 지락시의 건전상 대지\n\n전위상승이 가장 낮은 접지방식은?\n\n\n① 비접지 방식      ② 직접 접지 방식\n\n③ 고저항 접지 방식   ④ 소호리액터 접지 방식","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":321}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n반지름이 10cm, 소도체간 거리가 40cm, 등가선간\n\n거리가 1m인 복도체의 작용 인덕턴스가 다음과 같이\n\n주어질 때, 는 어떻게 표현되는가?\n\n          mHkm\n\n\n\n                               \n①            ②  log          log                         \n③ log        ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":592},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1234}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n3상 60Hz 4극, 10kW의 유도전동기가 전부하일 때\n\n회전속도가 1620rpm일 때, 유도전동기의 2차 효율은\n\n약 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 45          ② 90\n\n③ 95          ④ 98","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":648}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n60Hz의 변압기에 40Hz의 주파수를 인가하면 변압기\n\n철심의 자속밀도는 처음의 몇 배가 되는가?\n\n(단, 인가되는 전압의 크기는 일정하다.)\n\n\n    \n①             ②                                 \n\n    \n③             ④                                ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":705},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m08-e1.webp","width":696,"height":770}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n정격용량이 6000kVA , 정격전압이 6000V, 60Hz의\n\n3상 동기발전기의 단락비가 1.2인 경우, 1상당 동기 임피\n\n던스는 약 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n① 2.5          ② 3.0\n\n③ 3.5          ④ 5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":575},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1112}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n직권 계자의 권선저항이 0.1Ω, 전기자 저항이 0.3Ω\n\n인 직류 직권전동기에 100V의 전압을 인가하였더니\n\n부하전류가 10A였다. 이 경우, 전동기의 속도는 약 몇\n\nrpm인가? (단, 기계정수는 2이다.)\n\n\n① 1000         ② 1150\n\n③ 1260         ④ 1560","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m10-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1913}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n다음과 같은 전압의 실횻값은 약 몇 V인가?\n\n sinsinsinV\n\n\n\n① 15          ② 18\n\n③ 21          ④ 24","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":649},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m11-e1.webp","width":696,"height":620}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n기전력이 100V인 전원에 70Ω의 저항이 접속된 회로\n\n에 추가로 30Ω의 저항을 직렬로 접속하면 회로에 흐르\n\n는 전류는 몇 A가 되는가?\n\n\n\n\n① 0.5          ② 1\n\n③ 1.5          ④ 2","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":631},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m12-e1.webp","width":696,"height":380}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n어떤 회로에 V의 전압을 인가하니\n\nA 의 전류가 흘렀다. 이 회로의 임피던스는\n\n몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n①        ② \n\n③        ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e05-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e05-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":451}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P083-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(운전) (사람인) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 1